 "words_heard": 240,
 "words": 245,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A scoundrel named Sheba son of Bichri",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 5.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sounded the horn and cried out loud",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We have no share in David's rule",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "No inheritance in the son of Jesse",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To your tents Israel go away",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 5.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "All the men deserted the king",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.6,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But Judah stayed loyal and true",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.09,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From the Jordan river to Jerusalem",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "David told Amasa to summon the men",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.58,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Within three days be here at once",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But he took too long to gather them",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So Joab took command of the troops",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To your tents Israel go away",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All the men deserted the king",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But Judah stayed loyal and true",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the Jordan river to Jerusalem",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At the great stone in Gibeon they met",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Joab kissed him and drew the sword",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Amasa was not on guard at all",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And died on the ground without a second blow",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To your tents Israel go away",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All the men deserted the king",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Judah stayed loyal and true",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the Jordan river to Jerusalem",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sheba fled to Abel Beth Maacah",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Joab besieged the city walls",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A wise woman called out to speak",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Listen to the words of your servant",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Why would you swallow the Lord's inheritance",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.0,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To destroy a city that is a mother",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Her counsel was wise and she spoke with care",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hand over that one man to end the war",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They cut off the head of Sheba",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And threw it over the wall",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The horn was sounded and the men dispersed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each man to his own tent",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
 ],
